<title>BELGIUM: BEKAERT H1 1996 NET PROFIT FALLS 25 PCT.</title>
<headline>BEKAERT H1 1996 NET PROFIT FALLS 25 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in</p>
<p>billions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		    1.271  vs  1.703</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		     1.311  vs  1.796</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss		  0.100  vs  0.264  loss</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			 32.94  vs  32.05</p>
<p>    Cash flow			     3.084  vs  3.556</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgium's Bekaert NV is a leading world</p>
<p>manufacturer of steel wire and cord.</p>
<p>    Cons operating charges	   29.06  vs  27.62</p>
<p>    Gross operating profit	   3.881  vs  4.435</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 2.227  vs  1.929</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   1.654  vs  2.506</p>
<p>    Financial charges		  0.355  vs  0.513</p>
<p>    Taxes				  0.389  vs  0.446</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom tel. +322 287 6810</p>
<p>fax. +322 230 7710</p>
</text>
